      "content": "That exhaustion you feel is the heavy toll of fighting this long and losing the map you used to navigate. If the grand narrative feels finished, perhaps it's time to look at the smallest, most immediate moments instead of the whole story. Reaching out for professional support is a way of finding a new, external chapter to guide you through this blank space. Please, let someone help you carry this exhaustion right now.",
